# One rule: every text file is LF in the repository and in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary

# The binary types this project ships. Git's own NUL-byte heuristic would catch most of
# them; naming them means a new one is a deliberate line rather than a lucky detection.
*.bcmap binary
*.icc binary
*.ico binary
*.pfb binary
*.ttf binary
*.wasm binary
